




# Fly.io Steps
>>> 直接在 terminal 執行會比較好
1. fly auth login
2. fly apps create discord-cpsagent-bot -> 建立 Fly.io App
3. fly secrets set -a discord-cpsagent-bot \
  DISCORD_APPLICATION_TOKEN="你的DC Token" \
  DISCORD_GUILD_ID="你的DC Guild ID" \
  OPENAI_API_KEY="你的API_KEY" \
  TLDRAW_SERVICE_API_KEY="你的API_KEY" \
  TLDRAW_API_URL=https://discord-whiteboard.fly.dev \
  TLDRAW_PUBLIC_URL=https://discord-whiteboard.fly.dev
4. fly deploy -a discord-cpsagent-bot --ha=false

---

# Double Check
fly status -a discord-cpsagent-bot
fly logs -a discord-cpsagent-bot